Package: rkalos
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the Kalos Time Series Engine
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
  person("Angelika", "Meraner", email = "angelika.meraner@statistik.gv.at", role = c("aut","cre")),
  person("Alexander", "Kowarik", email = "alexander.kowarik@statistik.gv.at", role = c("ctb")),
  person("Markus", "Fröhlich", email = "markus.foehlich@statistik.gv.at", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Experimental R bindings to the independent Kalos C++ engine for
    fixed-order seasonal autoregressive integrated moving-average estimation,
    inference, prediction and X-11 primitives. Bundled core sources are built
    against the OpenBLAS C API (CBLAS/LAPACKE) provider, the numerical surface
    the qualified Kalos core is measured on; configure fails closed when it is
    unavailable (set KALOS_OPENBLAS_ROOT for non-standard installations).
    Full seasonal adjustment is not yet supported.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/statistikat/rkalos
BugReports: https://github.com/statistikat/rkalos/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++17, OpenMP (optional), OpenBLAS C API (cblas.h and
    lapacke.h with linkable CBLAS/LAPACKE symbols; KALOS_OPENBLAS_ROOT points
    at a non-standard installation)
Suggests: tinytest, jsonlite
